      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SAILAWAY BUDDY (1) scored (19.67) last time out at this track adding to an already respectable career. Form here sound including 10 wins. Ran one of the fastest times on the program in his latest win. Can make it two on the bounce. DAKOTA SHINE (2) was strongly fancied last time but finished second (19.77), beaten 0.8 lengths. Will give a great sight again. OUR REGARDS (4) stalked the lead from a middle draw and boxed on well to finish 7 lengths back in second (31.38) at this track in a Invitation over 530m. Goes very well from this draw with four wins and three minor placings from 10 starts. Expected to be in the finish again. OBSESSION (8) is a last-start placegetter at short odds – sure to have admirers again.",
